        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUpK8JsveGIjNiSTim0Rcr1N-4rv-LCJhC_Gg9mQAXmINF38C1j=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Pleasant staff, very thorough.  The optometrist took all the time needed for my detailed evaluation which was greatly appreciated.  This was my first time here, I recommend this location.",
        "time": 1763578437,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tiffany Norris",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100088411911805735983/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJFyfggwrQZc0YYbj27GhFeXuLQgwv8W-zU12jVAPlAKB0O9A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "If i can give 0 stars I would of! Rude customer service. Put a deposit down for glasses and to find out at pick up they sold the frames!!! Why ask for a deposit when they sell your frames and don't even refund you! 100% DONT RECOMMEND!!!!!!\nWorst place ever! Very rude and poor customer service!!!!! BE AWARE! Money grabbers!!!!",
        "time": 1747948104,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Riley Lenzi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118168476000179312142/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJG00g16l1i132E9MMAlKKM2i24R1kM6az8zsc1NTO34ubtIQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "I’ve been going here my whole life without issue, but the last few times I’ve had issues with language. Last 2 times I’ve gone in and began speaking I’m immediately met with “do you speak French?” Very unprofessional, this is people’s vision, you should be able to understand basic English while working here.",
        "time": 1741612320,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jacen Fossey",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111691681056540469360/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIWafAjI-UCBRW0rg0vUt-ZQuueTqNdnaEm_SgVjsanp6XHLf93=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "VERY fast service\n\nBooked on Monday, Tuesday got a call to confirm details, Thursday got a call to remind of the appt, and Friday had the appt.\n\nI saw Dr. Boulé, very good experience with all the staff there",
        "time": 1748620862,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jacqueline Morrissette",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104663562008556709680/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUB0kr_MICl1Wt3eRI5RbJfv6FavAn9Nq6Cr77zsY91uwTO0ht_vw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I warn you to stay away.\nFirst, the optometrist told me my astigmatism magically disappeared. (The chances of that are so low they might as well be non-existent.) The whole thing was super fast and seemed like a rush to get me onto the sales floor.\nWhen I got there, I was extremely disappointed that they seemed to carry the variations of only a couple of styles (none that I liked). I picked some anyways because of the convenience of them being close and me not having a car. Picked them up yesterday, it took about 4 hours for me to end up in so much pain from eye strain I couldn't look at a computer screen. Whatever I looked at would distort as I moved my head from right to left and it made me dizzy. I returned them first thing this morning. It's been more than 24 hours since I gave up on the glasses and my eyes still hurt.\nIf I was happy with the experience from the start, I would have given them a chance to fix it, but I wasn't.\nThe only good thing I can say is that they didn't hassle me about the return.",
        "time": 1680031669,
        "translated": false
      }
